{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54176","headline":"岩嵌绿玉 · 杨奇鲲","name":"岩嵌绿玉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天孙昔谪下天绿，雾鬓风鬟爱草木。\n一朝骑凤上丹霄，翠翘花钿留空谷。\n（见《明滇南诗略》卷首、民国五年周宗麟纂《大理县志稿》卷三一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨奇鲲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}